WEBVTT

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:48.980
Right! All finished! Hm...

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:57.830
Wait, for today's shoot,
it's just Kyo and Tomigai coming, so...

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:01.530
Heck, it'll be fine.
They're both growing boys.

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:04.400
Kyo's got a huge appetite just by himself!

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:13.050
Why is it? I'm always so
positive when I'm with Kyo.

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:15.580
I'm stronger. Yeah...

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:18.810
I feel like I can fly
even higher with him.

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:22.390
Oh, what am I going on about?!

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.730
See you later!

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:43.940
Where... am I?

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.050
That's all.

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:49.280
Adjourned!

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:53.720
Thank God that's over.

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:54.950
Kyo.

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:03.220
I was thinking of having you induct
Ryoko Kaminagi officially into Cerebrum.

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:08.430
Whether I agree
with it or not, right?

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:09.840
Correct.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:15.240
Results of our data analysis show
she'll make an excellent Cerebrant...

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:18.410
and we know she has an
aptitude for being a Wizard.

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:21.450
Not just that, but her levels
are reading very high.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:24.140
Kaminagi is going to be a Wizard?

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:26.850
Um... Commander?

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:28.890
One moment, please.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:32.020
That's why I want you
to help with her training.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:36.760
You're the only Gunner aboard this
ship that she's acquainted with.

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:39.600
And considering what
else happened in Maihama,

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:41.690
there's no one else
to leave this to.

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:44.600
I guess... But still!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:47.440
You don't want her involved in the fighting?

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:50.580
It's not like anyone here
<i>wants</i> to fight...

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:53.100
I know that without you having to tell me!

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:55.380
Then it's decided.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:58.680
Minato, prepare to transfer and
register Ryoko Kaminagi here.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:00.080
Aye, sir.

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:02.620
Commander, if you'd please?

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:04.820
If you have a report,
I'll take it on the bridge.

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:06.850
No sir, it's... Well, the truth is...

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.030
She's already here, sir.

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:15.130
Okay, Mr. Tarbo! Enough!

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:15.840
Wha?

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:17.000
Kaminagi!

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.640
What are you doing?!

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:23.200
Oh, Kyo. I'm not sure how,
but here I am.

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:24.870
Here you are?!

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:29.050
Everyone's as much fun
as you said they were!

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:30.350
Right, Mi-chan?

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:31.450
Right!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:32.510
Mi-chan?

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.710
What happened between those two?

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:40.820
What?! The student council
president and vice-president?!

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.230
Welcome aboard the Oceanus.

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.360
Th-Thank you.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.760
Oh, yeah! Is anyone hungry?

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:52.440
It doesn't look like much,
but I guarantee it tastes good.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.670
Well, perhaps one.

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:56.640
Please! Go ahead!

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.870
You can have some too,
Miss Vice-president.

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:00.910
Uh... Th-Thank you.

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:02.950
Hey, Kaminagi! Me, too!

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:04.940
Later, Kyo.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.050
Shizuno-sempai!

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:10.290
You're a Cerebrant, too?

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:12.280
Well, I look forward to working with you.

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:14.890
Please, feel free to have one.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:18.000
This is fried cod roe and
this is sweet bean paste.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.490
I think I'll have some of
the sweet bean ones.

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:26.640
<i>Wow... He's a guy, but he's so... pretty.</i>

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:30.180
Um, Kyo? Who's the cute guy over there?

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.680
That's Lu-shen.

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:34.310
So, his name's Lu-shen, huh?

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:38.580
Cute guy? What, she goes nuts
for someone like him?

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:40.110
I heard you, you know.

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:41.790
Oh! Sorry about that!

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:46.250
Kyo's not so handsome, so he's just
prejudiced against guys who are.

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.050
Here, have this as my apology!

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:49.830
Here.

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:54.270
What's the big idea, acting all
chummy with Lu-shen?!

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:55.130
Wow!

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:57.500
Now what?

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:04.900
Kyo, you said the crabby one is May-yu
and the cute one is May-yen, right?

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:07.580
They both look pretty cute, though.

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:11.640
Why, you!
Who are you calling crabby?!

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:13.780
Look, it's just...

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:16.480
You think I'm cute?!
Oh, you're too nice!

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:21.450
Here, for you, too.
I've also got tea, so help yourself.

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:30.360
This is incredible. It's just like a movie!

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:33.930
Can I get a smile from you, please?

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:38.210
Um, should we be allowing this?

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.970
It's not a problem.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:44.650
At the very least, we've never seen
an awakening pattern like this before.

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:47.620
She may be a rare prize, indeed.

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:48.960
You think so?

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:51.550
Well, despite everything,
I'd see this as a good thing.

00:06:56.230 --> 00:07:01.460
You know, I've thought so for a while...
You two make a nice couple.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.470
Oh?!

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:04.830
Really? Well, it's just your imagination.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:17.220
Oh, he is pretty.
Every side is his good side.

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:21.280
Sure, sure. And there's no side of
me that gets a good picture, huh?

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:26.550
Hey, cut it out!
You're interrupting Lu-shen's training!

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.290
I'm not interrupting it.

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:31.460
I'm just getting some shots
of him, Miss May-yen.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:34.270
May-YU! I'm May-YU!

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:36.100
It's all right, May-yu.

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:38.060
I gave her permission.

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:46.480
Careful, May-yen! She may
be after Lu-shen's rear seat!

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:49.070
What?! No way!

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:53.840
Oh... Is that how it is?

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:58.190
Of all those showing
signs of awakening,

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:01.350
the only one who has awakened
completely is Ryoko Kaminagi.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:06.000
To have come here by herself...
She may be the only one this time around.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:08.400
We have as little to work
with as we usually get.

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:11.860
You think so? I think we got
quality over quantity this time.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:14.030
We need quality <i>and</i> quantity.

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:16.870
Continue monitoring them.

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:28.390
This is the real surface of the earth, isn't it?

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:41.470
The A.I. people aboard were
programmed by the president, right?

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:44.740
Yeah, although apparently
they're modeled on people.

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:45.800
Now, if <i>I'd</i> programmed them...

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:49.730
Gards-orm, approaching!
Shifting vessel to defensive mode, meow!

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.450
All weapon locks, released, meow!

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:54.110
Field output, stabilized, meow!

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:56.350
Point-defense system, activated, meow!

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:59.320
Anti-air vulcan phalanx cannons,
standing by, meow!

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:01.610
Oceanus!
Ahead, full speed, meow!

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.990
Meow!

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:06.460
Oh, yeah...

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:12.760
So, this is Zegapain.

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:15.600
This is what you pilot in battle, huh, Kyo?

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:16.540
I guess.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:20.040
Thank you.
For protecting us till now.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.610
What are you talking about?!

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:25.770
They might make you get in this
thing and fight too, you know!

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:28.720
Yeah. I know.

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:30.480
Aren't you scared?!

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.580
We may just be meta-bodies,
but we can still die!

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:37.460
I am scared.
But I've made up my mind.

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:39.530
I've been protected till now.

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:42.490
So now it's my turn
to protect everyone else.

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:44.220
Besides...

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:49.290
Being with you will make me stronger.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:52.610
I can fly higher.

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:53.770
What's that mean?

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:57.080
Never mind.
You don't need to understand.

00:09:57.080 --> 00:09:59.140
Hey! Kaminagi, wait up!

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:00.970
I said wait up!

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.650
Wow, that was a lot of fun!

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:09.960
And I shot a ton of footage.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:14.860
Still, why do I feel like I forgot
something really important?

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:16.790
Something important?

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:25.100
Hey! Tomigai!

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.870
I'm so sorry!
I was going to call you, but...

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:31.140
We went somewhere
my cell phone couldn't work, so...

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:32.510
It's okay.

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:37.210
Oh, don't be mad.
We didn't mean to do it.

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:41.980
It's okay. It doesn't matter. Besides...

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:44.550
My forehead's started
glowing all of a sudden!

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:48.750
Do you think it's...
Do you think I'm sick?

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:05.710
Wow!

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:07.940
I look like the heroine in a sci-fi film!

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:09.440
Kinda sexy, too.

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:11.880
Thank you!

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:13.910
The simulator's ready for you.

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:16.710
It basically operates like the game.

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:19.590
First thing we need to do
is get you used to it.

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:21.130
Relax and give it a try.

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:23.120
Sure. I'll do my best.

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:26.960
All right! Here we go!

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:30.590
What's wrong?

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:36.070
Should I really be taking
Shizuno-sempai's seat like this?

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:39.110
Don't worry about that!

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:53.990
Here we go, Kaminagi!

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:54.480
Right!

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:57.960
Three Ulvorfuls, closing from 2 o'clock!

00:11:57.960 --> 00:11:58.990
Right!

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:04.560
Front grip weapon chamber coil output, okay!

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:06.670
Holonic field, forming!

00:12:06.670 --> 00:12:08.470
Holonic launcher, right hand!

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:30.400
You okay?!

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:32.390
I'm fine! Just fight, Kyo!

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:39.800
Got 'em!

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:43.010
<i>8 more Ulvorfuls,</i>
<i>approaching from 9 o'clock!</i>

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:44.770
<i>I'm on it!</i>

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:45.540
Ah...

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:52.180
We need to rethink our pilot roster, don't we?

00:12:52.690 --> 00:12:55.050
Yes. It's good, isn't it?

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:00.420
You want another Wizard?

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:04.000
Uh, well... There's nothing
wrong with you, Sempai.

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:08.460
You've saved me a bunch of times,
and I really appreciate it.

00:13:09.170 --> 00:13:09.970
Kyo...

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:12.910
But, I...
I want to protect her!

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:17.900
If Kaminagi is going to pilot a Zega,
then I want to be in there with her!

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.080
Very well.

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:22.170
Thank you, Sempai.

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:28.120
I guess a kiss can only break
a magic spell in fairy tales.

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:30.060
Yehl?

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:32.580
To be a Gunner or
a Wizard is a sort of talent.

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:38.030
A great Wizard is great from the moment
they awaken. That's just how it is.

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:39.970
What's gotten into you?

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:41.520
What?!

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:42.600
What's wrong?

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:45.400
They've downed 20 units
in barely 120 seconds!

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:48.100
They've cleared level three real
battle mode without a single miss!

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:50.480
I've never seen anything like this!

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:52.550
<i>Kaminagi! Holonic blade!</i>

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:54.210
<i>Already deployed!</i>

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:59.650
What the?! She can anticipate
her Gunner's commands?!

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.550
How can she know that?!

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:06.390
Well, well... Seems we've gained
ourselves an actual Witch.

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:07.750
A Witch?

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:10.830
Very rarely, you find Wizards
able to establish...

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:13.390
a telepathic data link with their Gunner.

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:16.330
Gunners refer to them as Witches.

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:18.800
She's graduated from the simulator.

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:25.410
Forty seconds of combat time remaining!

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:26.950
Piece of cake!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:30.180
<i>I'm fine. I'll be fine.</i>

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:35.040
<i>Because...</i>
<i>I'll be with Kyo from now on.</i>

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:45.060
<i>As long as I'm with Kyo,</i>
<i>I can hang on.</i>

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:49.860
<i>As long as I'm with Kyo,</i>
<i>I can be strong.</i>

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:57.770
<i>As long as I'm with him,</i>
<i>I can fly higher.</i>

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:03.780
Deactivating Pellucidar mode!

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:09.080
<i>Gunner and Wizard I.D.s, locked.</i>
<i>Stand by for meta-body transmission.</i>

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:14.830
<i>This may just be training, but it's a
real recon mission, so stay alert!</i>

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.730
Roger that, Mi-chan.

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.500
<i>Shift to Cerebrant mode.</i>

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:19.120
Acknowledged.

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:21.730
<i>C.P.W. link to Ryoko!</i>

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.700
<i>H.P.G. link to Kyo!</i>

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.960
<i>Transmission airspace scan, complete.</i>

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:28.070
<i>E.X. connection, green!</i>

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:31.940
<i>She's an amazing girl.</i>
<i>Not just for her abilities.</i>

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:35.780
<i>Since she's come, the atmosphere</i>
<i>here has brightened up.</i>

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:40.080
<i>All sorts of things really are</i>
<i>happening aboard this ship.</i>

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.140
Restoration coordinates, set and locked!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.560
<i>Releasing hangar lock!</i>

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:46.490
<i>Altair, transmit!</i>

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:47.620
Entangle!

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:03.430
The ocean!
That's the real ocean, isn't it?

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:06.340
Oh, I wish I'd brought my camera with me!

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:08.340
Now, look!

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:11.470
I'm just kidding!
But a little serious, too...

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:17.310
I heard we lost three Zegas
on the African front.

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:21.780
<i>Because the speed of the enemy's weapons</i>
<i>development is growing even faster.</i>

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:25.160
You're right. We need to
develop something to counter it.

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:28.970
<i>We're currently developing</i>
<i>a high-energy quantum weapon.</i>

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:30.300
I'm counting on you.

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.140
<i>Until later.</i>

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:33.470
What do you think?

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.270
I'm afraid it's a new Gards-orm weapon.

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:38.040
You don't suppose they developed it...

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:39.670
based on the data stolen
from the Altair, do you?

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:41.650
It's a strong possibility.

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:43.320
We need to improve our warning systems.

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:44.370
Roger.

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:48.590
Gards-orm raiding squadron,
approaching from 3 o'clock!

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.060
<i>Aanvals approaching.</i>

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:53.690
Radar contact!

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:56.600
Aanvals approaching
from 11 o'clock! Six units!

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:57.700
What?

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.770
<i>We've been spotted by the enemy!</i>
<i>Can you handle this?</i>

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.870
What about the Garuda
and the Hraesvelg?

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:05.130
<i>They're already engaging another force!</i>

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.810
Kyo, I'll be okay!

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:17.040
I've made up my mind.
I'm not afraid.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:20.780
Gotcha.

00:17:26.590 --> 00:17:28.490
<i>I've made up my mind, too.</i>

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:30.160
<i>To protect you, no matter what!</i>

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.160
HERE WE GO!

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:36.770
Combat time limit:
8 minutes, 20 seconds!

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:42.340
Holonic field, forming!
Holonic blade, right hand!

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:00.690
You've got it, Kaminagi!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:05.130
My God...

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:07.860
The Gunner and Wizard's data are linked.

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.240
No doubt about it.
She's a Witch.

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:14.470
All right!

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:15.270
<i>Warning!</i>

00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:16.760
Kyo! Behind us!

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:23.810
Oh, a wise guy, huh?!

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:29.420
Both arm actuators are damaged!

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:33.150
Gimme 20 seconds!

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:40.130
Cutting numbers 2, 6, and 9!

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:42.290
Bypassing via 7, 12, and 15!

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:50.140
Power, linked! Move them!

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.480
Kyo! Let's GO!

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:55.000
YEAH!

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:59.910
Leave me the hell alone!

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:13.260
Altair's mission, complete.
Activating recovery sequence.

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:16.160
Garuda and Hraesvelg have
both finished fighting as well.

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:26.610
You did great, Kaminagi!

00:19:26.610 --> 00:19:27.480
You too, Kyo.

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:38.290
Huh?

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:39.730
What's wrong?

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:41.890
I'm confirming the activation
of a quantum weapon.

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:45.560
There are four holonic
loaders above the field.

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:48.470
Four? Is there a Zega from
another ship out there?

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:50.560
No! The I.D. signal reads as "unknown."

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:53.200
You don't think it's!

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:54.870
Gards-orm?!

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:09.040
Hey, Kyo?

00:20:09.860 --> 00:20:12.060
The truth is, I...

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:14.650
When I'm with you, it's like I'm flying.

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:18.230
So, what's that supposed to mean?

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:21.720
Will I get used to all this?

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:24.600
Like Shizuno-sempai
and Miss Arque did?

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.040
Of course you will.

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:28.870
With you, I don't doubt it!

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:30.610
Kyo...

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.110
What the?!

00:20:39.850 --> 00:20:42.510
<i>Emergency transmission, commencing!</i>

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:47.950
<i>Entangle, time out.</i>

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:10.280
Recover them both! Hurry!

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:18.720
Commander! Ryoko Kaminagi is!

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:25.130
Transmission failure.
Her meta-body data has been lost.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:28.120
Ryoko Kaminagi... has been destroyed.

00:22:51.220 --> 00:22:54.390
The Anti-Zega.
The Gards-orm's new weapon.

00:22:54.390 --> 00:22:56.360
The thing that took Kaminagi's life.

00:22:56.360 --> 00:22:59.860
Kaminagi's disappeared.
She's just vanished.

00:22:59.860 --> 00:23:02.160
But I can't understand it!

00:23:02.160 --> 00:23:04.530
Why did she have to die?!

00:23:04.530 --> 00:23:07.870
Why was humanity destroyed and
forced to become meta-bodies?!

00:23:07.870 --> 00:23:12.870
Who the hell are these
Gards-orm that we're fighting?!

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:16.210
Next time, on Zegapain:
"Memories of Destruction."

00:23:16.210 --> 00:23:18.940
My pain, never to be forgotten...
